  "body": "Immerse yourself in coastal living with this stunning new 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom design-build home by David Reid Homes. Located in the heart of Long Bay, this property combines modern luxury with a tranquil seaside lifestyle.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nPremium Coastal Location: Situated on a 436m² section, just a short stroll from Long Bay Beach and Reserve.\r\nSpacious & Modern Living: 180m² of thoughtfully designed, open-plan living space with high-quality finishes.\r\nVibrant Village Atmosphere: Enjoy the convenience of the Long Bay Village, offering boutique cafes, eateries, and bars, all within walking distance.\r\nTop Schools: Zoned for the highly regarded Long Bay College.\r\nMaster Builders Guarantee: Offering peace of mind and assurance of quality craftsmanship.\r\n\r\nNestled on Auckland's scenic North Shore, Long Bay offers the best of coastal living. Wake up to the sound of the waves, take a stroll along the beach, or explore the surrounding parks. With convenient motorway access and a strong community vibe, it's an unparalleled lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe Long Bay Effect: A lifestyle that blends the tranquility of nature with the convenience of city living. Whether you're relaxing on the deck or walking to the village, every moment here feels like a retreat.\r\n\r\nFor more details, contact Jamie or Dean today to make this dream home your reality.\r\n* Please copy and paste the below hyperlink to view the David Reid Homes website:\r\nwww.davidreidhomes.co.nz",
